									        <p class="small mt-3 mb-5">
											    * Preview Ticket​ (Max. 4 days of entry)<br />
											    * General Admission before 3pm / after 3pm (1 day entry from the time and date stated on the ticket)<br />
											    <b>* With General Admission First Access, you may re-enter after 3:00 PM once you have entered for the first time.</b><br />
											    * General Admission Kiaf (Access on Sept. 6 only)<br />
											    * The 2026 Korea Art Festival Special Discount Ticket is supported by the Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism of Korea and offers discounted
											    General Admission (GA) tickets to Kiaf / Frieze Seoul.<br />
											    * All ticket types, including the 2026 Korea Art Festival Special Discount Ticket, are available in limited quantities and may sell out early.
